  "description": "EH3D-VALIDATION-LAB is the test environment of the PHOENIX family. Today it holds a library and a command line that write and verify the manifest of a golden set against redundant copies, read results in which every failure carries a class, and compare a run with a baseline. It has only run on data made by its own tests; the comparison with golden files is not written.",
